## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.5 0.8B
- **Short description:** Qwen Team's ultra-compact 2026-model, part of the Qwen 3.5 family. Positioned as a minimal-footprint model for edge and resource-constrained workloads. Released alongside Qwen 3.5 1.8B and Qwen 3.5 3B. Available via Alibaba Cloud and Qwen API. Designed for efficient inference and lightweight agentic tasks.
- **Provider / access:** Qwen Team (`qwen-3.5-0.8b`); via Alibaba Cloud and Qwen API. Free tier available on Zen with daily rate limits; additional credits available via Alibaba Cloud tiered plans.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-10 release; knowledge cutoff Oct 2026. Default snapshot: qwen-3.5-0.8b-exp-2026-10.
- **IDs:** `qwen-3.5-0.8b` (Alibaba Cloud, Qwen API); proprietary quantized model (4-bit quantized for efficiency).
- **Context window:** 8,000 tokens total (verified via Alibaba Cloud docs and model card); 4,000 max output limit. Designed for short prompt workloads; adequate for simple agentic tasks and retrieval-augmented generation. 4K token max output limit is reasonable relative to 8K token context.
- **Modalities:** Text input only; text output. "Text-optimized per design" per Qwen Team; no image or audio perception supported. Text-only modality is the primary design choice.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10):** Free tier: 500K input tokens / 250K output tokens per day per user. Beyond free tier: $0.05 input / $0.25 output per 1M tokens. Very cost-effective for resource-constrained workloads. $0.90 cached input (90% discount) further improves value for heavy workloads.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary quantized model from Qwen Team. Parameter count not publicly disclosed (4-bit quantized); not MoE. Training compute, hardware, dataset size, and cutoff not disclosed. Quantized for inference efficiency.

